  "text": "Now I have precise numbers. Here are several Mermaid diagrams covering the architecture and migration status.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Router Component Architecture\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph Bootstrap[\"Bootstrap Flow\"]\n        A[\"index.ts\"] --> B[\"initApp.ts\"]\n        B --> C[\"app.ts — GrafanaApp.init()\"]\n        C --> D[\"createRoot().render()\"]\n    end\n\n    D --> AW\n\n    subgraph App[\"React Component Tree\"]\n        AW[\"AppWrapper\"]\n        AW --> RP[\"Redux Provider\"]\n        AW --> GC[\"GrafanaContext Provider\"]\n        AW --> TP[\"ThemeProvider\"]\n        AW --> RW[\"RouterWrapper<br/><i>RoutesWrapper.tsx</i>\"]\n\n        RW --> R[\"Router<br/><i>react-router-dom v5</i><br/>history = locationService.getHistory()\"]\n        R --> LSP[\"LocationServiceProvider\"]\n        LSP --> CR[\"CompatRouter<br/><i>react-router-dom-v5-compat</i><br/>Bridges v5 ↔ v6 APIs\"]\n        CR --> AC[\"AppChrome<br/><i>Shell / Layout / Nav</i>\"]\n        AC --> Routes[\"&lt;Routes&gt;<br/><i>v6 compat</i>\"]\n\n        Routes --> R1[\"Route /d/:uid/:slug?\"]\n        Routes --> R2[\"Route /explore\"]\n        Routes --> R3[\"Route /alerting/*\"]\n        Routes --> R4[\"Route /admin/*\"]\n        Routes --> RN[\"Route ... <i>~100+ routes</i>\"]\n\n        R1 --> GRW[\"GrafanaRouteWrapper\"]\n        R2 --> GRW\n        R3 --> GRW\n        R4 --> GRW\n        RN --> GRW\n\n        GRW --> AUTH{\"Auth Check<br/>Signed in?\"}\n        AUTH -->|No| LOGIN[\"/login redirect\"]\n        AUTH -->|Yes| RBAC{\"RBAC Check<br/>Has role?\"}\n        RBAC -->|No| HOME[\"/ redirect\"]\n        RBAC -->|Yes| GR[\"GrafanaRoute\"]\n\n        GR --> EB[\"ErrorBoundary\"]\n        EB --> SU[\"Suspense<br/><i>SafeDynamicImport</i>\"]\n        SU --> PC[\"Page Component<br/><i>route.component</i>\"]\n    end\n\n    style Bootstrap fill:#2b2923,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style App fill:#1b1913,stroke:#666,color:#edecec\n    style CR fill:#26241e,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style R fill:#26241e,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Navigation Pattern: Legacy vs New\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph Legacy[\"LEGACY — locationService (singleton)\"]\n        direction TB\n        LS[\"locationService<br/><i>@grafana/runtime</i>\"]\n        LS --> PUSH[\"push('/path')\"]\n        LS --> REPLACE[\"replace('/path')\"]\n        LS --> PARTIAL[\"partial({ key: val })\"]\n        LS --> HIST[\"getHistory()\"]\n        HIST --> ROUTER[\"Router component<br/><i>single history instance</i>\"]\n\n        ILC[\"interceptLinkClicks.ts<br/><i>document click handler</i>\"] --> PUSH\n        UQP[\"useQueryParams()<br/>useUrlParams()\"] --> PARTIAL\n    end\n\n    subgraph New[\"NEW — React Router hooks\"]\n        direction TB\n        UN[\"useNavigate()\"]\n        UN --> NAV[\"navigate('/path')\"]\n        UN --> NAVR[\"navigate('/path', { replace: true })\"]\n        UL[\"useLocation()\"]\n        UP[\"useParams()\"]\n        USP[\"useSearchParams()\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Bridge[\"Compat Bridge Layer\"]\n        direction TB\n        COMPAT[\"react-router-dom-v5-compat<br/><i>v6 hooks work inside v5 Router</i>\"]\n    end\n\n    Legacy ---|\"shared history\"| Bridge\n    Bridge ---|\"exposes v6 API\"| New\n\n    style Legacy fill:#4a1a1a,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style New fill:#1a3a1a,stroke:#4a4,color:#edecec\n    style Bridge fill:#2b2923,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Migration Progress by Feature Area\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'} }%%\ngraph TD\n    subgraph Status[\"Migration Status Key\"]\n        direction LR\n        DONE[\"✅ Migrated to useNavigate\"]\n        FLAG[\"🚩 Feature flag defined\"]\n        TODO[\"⬜ Not started — uses locationService\"]\n        INFRA[\"⚙️ Shared infrastructure\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Migrated[\"✅ MIGRATED (25 files use useNavigate)\"]\n        P[\"provisioning/<br/>22 files — useNavigate\"]\n        ADM2[\"admin/UserCreatePage<br/>1 file\"]\n        ALERT2[\"alerting/ConfirmVersionRestore<br/>1 file\"]\n        GOPS[\"gops/ConfigureIRM<br/>1 file\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Flagged[\"🚩 FEATURE FLAGS DEFINED (not yet wired)\"]\n        PL[\"playlist/<br/>4 files · locationService.push<br/><i>playlistUseNavigate</i>\"]\n        TM[\"teams/<br/>1 file · locationService.push<br/><i>teamsUseNavigate</i>\"]\n        SA[\"serviceaccounts/<br/>2 files · locationService.push<br/><i>serviceAccountsUseNavigate</i>\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Remaining[\"⬜ NOT STARTED — locationService calls\"]\n        AL[\"alerting/<br/>15 files · .push\"]\n        DS[\"dashboard/<br/>11 files · .push\"]\n        DSC[\"dashboard-scene/<br/>15 files · .push\"]\n        EX[\"explore/<br/>3 files · .push\"]\n        BD[\"browse-dashboards/<br/>3 files · .push\"]\n        CONN[\"connections/<br/>2 files · .push\"]\n        AUTH2[\"auth-config/<br/>1 file · .push\"]\n        VARS[\"variables/<br/>3 files · .partial\"]\n        SEARCH[\"search/<br/>2 files\"]\n        OTHER[\"scopes, plugins, inspector,<br/>library-panels, org, live,<br/>command-palette, support-bundles<br/>~10 files\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Infra[\"⚙️ SHARED INFRA — must migrate last\"]\n        KB[\"keybindingSrv.ts<br/>15 calls (.push + .partial)\"]\n        ILC2[\"interceptLinkClicks.ts<br/>1 .push\"]\n        HOOKS[\"useQueryParams.ts<br/>useUrlParams.ts<br/>useURLSearchParams.ts<br/>3 hooks using .partial\"]\n        CHROME[\"AppChromeService.tsx<br/>2 .partial\"]\n    end\n\n    style Status fill:#201e18,stroke:#666,color:#edecec\n    style Migrated fill:#1a3a1a,stroke:#4a4,color:#edecec\n    style Flagged fill:#3a3a1a,stroke:#aa4,color:#edecec\n    style Remaining fill:#4a1a1a,stroke:#a44,color:#edecec\n    style Infra fill:#1a1a3a,stroke:#44a,color:#edecec\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. Migration Flow (per-feature process)\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'} }%%\nflowchart LR\n    A[\"1. Define feature flag<br/><i>pkg/services/featuremgmt/</i>\"] --> B[\"2. Add useNavigate<br/>to component\"]\n    B --> C[\"3. Conditional branch<br/><i>if (featureToggle)<br/>  navigate()<br/>else<br/>  locationService.push()</i>\"]\n    C --> D[\"4. Test both paths<br/><i>flag on + flag off</i>\"]\n    D --> E[\"5. Enable flag<br/>in production\"]\n    E --> F[\"6. Remove flag +<br/>delete legacy code\"]\n\n    style A fill:#26241e,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style B fill:#26241e,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style C fill:#26241e,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style D fill:#26241e,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style E fill:#26241e,stroke:#f54e00,color:#edecec\n    style F fill:#1a3a1a,stroke:#4a4,color:#edecec\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Overall Progress Summary\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'} }%%\npie title locationService vs useNavigate (by file count)\n    \"useNavigate (migrated)\" : 25\n    \"Feature-flagged (pending)\" : 7\n    \"locationService.push (remaining)\" : 75\n    \"locationService.partial (remaining)\" : 55\n    \"locationService.replace (remaining)\" : 24\n    \"Shared infra (migrate last)\" : 6\n```\n\n---\n\n### Reading the Diagrams\n\n1. **Diagram 1** shows the full React component tree from bootstrap through routing to page rendering. The key piece is the **CompatRouter** bridge sitting between the v5 `Router` and the v6 `<Routes>` / `<Route>` elements.\n\n2. **Diagram 2** contrasts the two navigation paradigms. The legacy `locationService` singleton is an imperative API that feeds a `history` object to the router. The new pattern uses React hooks (`useNavigate`, `useLocation`, etc.) exposed through the compat bridge.\n\n3. **Diagram 3** breaks down every feature area by migration status:\n   - **25 files** (mostly provisioning) are fully migrated\n   - **7 files** (playlist, teams, service accounts) have feature flags defined but not yet wired\n   - **~75 files** still use `locationService.push`, plus **~55** using `.partial` and **~24** using `.replace`\n   - **~6 shared infrastructure files** (keybinding service, link interception, query param hooks) must be migrated last since they're consumed across many features\n\n4. **Diagram 4** shows the repeatable per-feature migration workflow: define flag, add hook, branch conditionally, test both paths, enable in prod, clean up.\n\n5. **Diagram 5** (pie chart) gives the at-a-glance ratio — roughly **13%** of navigation call sites have been migrated so far, with the vast majority still on `locationService`.",
